# the mcu box this client talks to (mcuctl, remote.sh, the MCP server);
# copy to .env.local (git-ignored), or point MCU_CONFIG at another file
#
# your project's user on the box: mcu-<project>@<host>
MCU_HOST=mcu-PROJECT@HOST
# the project's private key, anywhere outside the repo, mode 600 (optional:
# ssh's default keys otherwise)
# MCU_KEY=/path/to/mcu.key
# the box's admin only: your account on it (with sudo), for `mcuctl admin ...`
# MCU_ADMIN_HOST=you@HOST
# MCU_ADMIN_KEY=/path/to/admin.key
# remote.sh only: benchfile | repo, skips asking the box at each run
# MCU_MODE=benchfile
